<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sinter Metals started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sinter Metals started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it started coverage of Sinter Metals Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Said expects Sinter's earnings per share growth to average 20 percent annually over the next five years.</p>
<p>-- 1997 earnings estimate is $1.70 per share, up 29 percent from pro forma earnings of $1.32 per share in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Estimates 1998 earnings at $2.10 per share.  </p>
<p>-- Said 1998 estimate assumes &quot;conservative cost savings&quot; from recent acquisitions.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed at 25-3/8 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
